//! The game's classes (generated by `piney-gen gen` from Infection's DWARF
//! and every volume's symbols; do not edit): [`GameClass`] names one, its
//! row of [`CLASSES`] holds its name, its base and its constructor and
//! vtable on each volume. A class is listed when it has a vtable or a
//! constructor on some volume, or is the base of one that does. The
//! families are narrow enums with the same discriminants.

